{"3655960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales Beyond The Tomb - White Silence", "steam_appid": 3655960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some trails should remain untouched.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new episode of the <i>Tales Beyond The Tomb</i> series — colder, more isolated, and more disturbing than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events that were never fully explained, this chapter takes the player to a remote mountain range haunted by wind, ice, and secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a suffocating atmosphere, immersive audio design, and moments of pure psychological horror, this is a journey back to a place that was never meant to be rediscovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important:</strong> This is a slow-paced walking simulator with a narrative focus. <i>White Silence</i> is about atmosphere, immersion, and discovery at your own pace. It’s for players who enjoy exploring, observing, and piecing the story together through the environment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.poster.avif?t=1785399312\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.webm?t=1785399312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.mp4?t=1785399312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 4: White Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, a group of young explorers vanished during an expedition into a remote and frozen mountain region. Weeks later, their bodies were found scattered across the terrain — barefoot, wounded, and frozen in expressions of sheer terror. The case was quickly closed. No answers. No survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you play as a determined investigator, returning to the scene in search of the truth. Accompanied only by a local guide, you must retrace the steps of the doomed expedition, confronting the freezing cold, growing isolation, and the eerie feeling that something — or someone — still lingers in those mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to the truth.<br>But some truths should never be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.poster.avif?t=1785399312\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.webm?t=1785399312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.mp4?t=1785399312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic –</strong> Go back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films from the 80s and 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic Graphics and Immersive Environments -</strong> Feel the terror with realistic visuals and terrifying environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration - </strong>Discover tapes, documents, and remnants of the original expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End - </strong>An ambiguous, disturbing ending — just like the case it's inspired by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Text System –</strong> Immerse yourself in the story with dynamic, narrative dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold and Insanity -</strong> Sometimes the freezing winds of the mountains can cause some disturbances and hallucinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically an immersive first-person walking simulator with an engaging story. Investigate and explore a cold and inhospitable region... Take care of your sanity and be careful not to freeze to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some trails should remain untouched.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new episode of the <i>Tales Beyond The Tomb</i> series — colder, more isolated, and more disturbing than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events that were never fully explained, this chapter takes the player to a remote mountain range haunted by wind, ice, and secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a suffocating atmosphere, immersive audio design, and moments of pure psychological horror, this is a journey back to a place that was never meant to be rediscovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important:</strong> This is a slow-paced walking simulator with a narrative focus. <i>White Silence</i> is about atmosphere, immersion, and discovery at your own pace. It’s for players who enjoy exploring, observing, and piecing the story together through the environment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.poster.avif?t=1785399312\" wi