b_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic –</strong> Go back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films from the 80s and 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic Graphics and Immersive Environments -</strong> Feel the terror with realistic visuals and terrifying environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration - </strong>Discover tapes, documents, and remnants of the original expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End - </strong>An ambiguous, disturbing ending — just like the case it's inspired by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Text System –</strong> Immerse yourself in the story with dynamic, narrative dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold and Insanity -</strong> Sometimes the freezing winds of the mountains can cause some disturbances and hallucinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically an immersive first-person walking simulator with an engaging story. Investigate and explore a cold and inhospitable region... Take care of your sanity and be careful not to freeze to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Years after a tragic expedition, investigator Aleksei Morozov returns to the frozen mountains to uncover the truth. But some trails should never be followed...", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/2b1e91a9a41cc545fb58dbb924b57ab309de5c30/header.jpg?t=1785399312", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/80d5a9143ab1d9e4f15a745fba1e4b563ff61906/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785399312", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstat